Z||000000||fieroshop||12-31-1995||08:09 PM||||Well after making a few attempts at paint my GT, I finally got it painte. We were supposed to have painted the GT last Monday, then it went to Tuesday and finally on Wednesday we took the Gt to the spray booth that we rented for a day. We painted the car and when we went to pick it up on Thursday we found that while in the booth the GT got wet on Wednesday when it rained and hailed in the bay area. So back to the shop and two more days of preparation. My painter had to go home early and since I had to get the car painted asap as the poker run is on Sunday ane we have a show that day. I wanted my GT to show and hopefully win a trophy.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Trophy_2.JPG"> <BR>So I did the painting myself and it turned out great. Here is the car still in our prep area where I painted the car instead of renting a spray booth again, since they cost a $100.00 a day.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Hood1_1.JPG"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Scoop3.JPG"> <BR>||||reg||10
